      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.88 (vs ₹6.18 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.88 (down from ₹6.18 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹6.66b (down 6.7% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹804.2m (down 52% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 12% (down from 24% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was primarily driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 3% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 14% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
